# p2-relief.drv - Phase 2 tour: the start system's rocky moon close up on
# the system map (W4 regression check).
#
# Verifies: W4 (crater bowls and ground relief) keys airless bodies only,
# so a rocky body (model word $7e) is drawn exactly as before W4.
# Run:  tools/p2shots --routes relief --base BASE --branch BRANCH
# Expect: 01 the map zoomed in seven times on the moon, day side to the
#         left, the terminator down the middle; 02 zoomed in twice more;
#         03 the same view 0.5 s later. Base and branch alike in all three
#         (the dark discs on the moon are the model's own polygons, not
#         PS_CRATER circles).
# Start 1 (landed), new game only. Each shot pauses the game (Esc); the
# pointer is parked off the controls so no hover tip is drawn.

wait 6000
key space
wait 2000
key 1             # start position 1: landed
wait 11000
# F2, F2: the system map; pick the rocky moon, then zoom in (F7).
sdlkey f2
wait 2500
sdlkey f2
wait 2500
mouse 178 55
wait 300
click 200
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
mouse 2 120
wait 300
sdlkey esc
wait 500
shot 01-map-x7
sdlkey f1 shift
wait 300
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
mouse 2 120
wait 300
sdlkey esc
wait 500
shot 02-map-x9
sdlkey f1 shift
wait 500
sdlkey esc
wait 500
shot 03-map-x9-0.5s
sdlkey f1 shift
wait 300
quit
